  "title": "OR Royalties Announces Acquisition of a Precious Metals Stream on Canadian Copper’s New Brunswick Assets",
  "summary": "Download in pdf MONTRÉAL, April 14, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — OR Royalties Inc. (“OR Royalties”, “OR” or the “Company”) (OR: TSX & NYSE) is pleased to announce that it has entered into a binding agreement with Canadian Copper Inc. (CCI: CSE) (“Canadian Copper”) with respect to a $28.0 million precious metals stream (the “Stream”) […]",
